s  perfect sense because the post-credits  scene for ant-man and the wasp is  directly  in avengers infinity war and that of  course takes us to avengers infinity war  and avengers end game and that is the  new official  mcu watch order from disney plus and  marvel  now one thing to note here is that  spider-man homecoming and spider-man far  from home are not included in this list  and the reason i'm assuming these two  spider-man films are not on this list is  because this list  is coming from disney plus and disney  plus does not yet have spider-man  homecoming and spider-man far from home  on their platform yet but of course we  know where they would go in the mcu  you can watch spider-man homecoming  after the events of captain america  civil war  and of course spider-man far from home  is the last movie of phase 3 watched  right after avengers in game so this is  the new  official watch order for the mcu and it  seems to be primarily chronological  which makes a ton of sense and i'm  personally really excited to watch it in  this order  so let me know what you think about this  order and let me know in the comments  down below if you yourself are going to  be watching it in this order as well  don't forget to give the video a like  and subscribe so you don't miss out on  any of the latest  mcu news for live updates you can follow  me on instagram and twitter and as  always thank you all so much for  watching  woof
 

